# --- Local customization fork: build artifacts from per-VFX-platform builds ---
# Upstream's "_install/*" only covers a directory named exactly "_install"; builds that
# target a specific VFX platform use suffixed directories (_install_cy2025, ...).
# Patterns below are root-anchored so they never shadow tracked files deeper in the tree
# (e.g. src/plugins/rv-packages/additional_nodes/AdditionalNodes.zip).
/_install*/
/_codec_test*/
/_tmp*/
/*.zip
/*.log
